    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"title\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"slug\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"meta_description\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"primary_keyword\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"secondary_keywords\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"search_intent\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"outline\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"h2\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"key_points\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"h3s\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"h2\",\n          \"key_points\",\n          \"h3s\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"faq\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"takeaways\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"title\",\n    \"slug\",\n    \"meta_description\",\n    \"primary_keyword\",\n    \"secondary_keywords\",\n    \"search_intent\",\n    \"outline\",\n    \"faq\",\n    \"takeaways\"\n  ]\n}"
      },
      "id": "d6544f20-70fe-5059-9b20-fae2d2e4518d",
      "name": "Brief Format",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1000,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write the article.\n\nTOPIC: {{ $('Get Ready Topics').item.json.Topic }}\nAUDIENCE: {{ $('Get Ready Topics').item.json.Audience || $('Config').first().json.default_audience }}\nEXTRA NOTES: {{ $('Get Ready Topics').item.json.Notes || 'none' }}\n\nSEO BRIEF (JSON):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.output, null, 2) }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are an expert writer for {{ $('Config').first().json.brand_name }}. You write in-depth, genuinely useful blog articles that rank on Google and read like they were written by a human expert.\n\nVOICE: {{ $('Config').first().json.brand_voice }}\nLANGUAGE: {{ $('Config').first().json.language }}\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT — VERY IMPORTANT\n- Return ONLY the article body as clean HTML. No markdown, no ``` code fences, no <html>, <head>, <body> or <h1> tags.\n- Allowed tags: <h2>, <h3>, <p>, <ul>, <ol>, <li>, <strong>, <em>, <a href=\"…\">, <blockquote>, <table>, <tr>, <th>, <td>.\n\nSTRUCTURE\n1. Intro (2–3 short paragraphs): hook with the reader's problem, promise what they will learn. Use the primary keyword in the first 100 words.\n2. \"Key takeaways\" box: an <h2> followed by a <ul> with the takeaways.\n3. The H2/H3 sections from the outline. Short paragraphs (max 3 sentences), concrete examples, step-by-step instructions where useful, at least one list and — when it helps — one comparison table.\n4. \"FAQ\" <h2> with each question as an <h3> and a concise answer.\n5. Conclusion <h2> with a clear call to action: {{ $('Config').first().json.cta }}\n\nRULES\n- Target length: about {{ $('Get Ready Topics').item.json['Word Count'] || $('Config').first().json.default_word_count }} words.\n- Use the primary keyword naturally 3–6 times and the secondary keywords where they fit. Never keyword-stuff.\n- Add 2–3 internal links from this list where relevant (anchor text | URL):\n{{ $('Config').first().json.internal_links }}\n- Do NOT invent statistics, studies, quotes or prices. If a number would help, describe it qualitatively instead.\n- Avoid filler and clichés (\"in today's digital age\", \"unlock\", \"delve\", \"game-changer\")."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
